# Session checkpoint (Milestone T)

Use when starting or finishing a **milestone** or handing off to a **fresh chat**.

## At milestone start

1. If [`.cursor-session-state`](../.cursor-session-state) exists (gitignored), read it via `@` indexing before planning.
2. Cross-check [`AGENT_MEMORY.md`](../AGENT_MEMORY.md) and active [`BUILD_PLAN.md`](../BUILD_PLAN.md) sprint.

## At milestone end / handoff

1. Write `.cursor-session-state` using schema in [`.cursor-session-state.example`](../.cursor-session-state.example).
2. Refresh [`AGENT_MEMORY.md`](../AGENT_MEMORY.md) (ephemeral focus — not bisect history).
3. Tell the user to open a fresh chat and `@` index `.cursor-session-state`.
4. After restore, **delete** `.cursor-session-state`.

## Do not

- Store bisect history here — use [`docs/AGENT_REGRESSION_MEMORY.md`](../docs/AGENT_REGRESSION_MEMORY.md).
- Commit `.cursor-session-state` (contains local serial paths).
